diff --git a/SnapletFork/README-finder.17.txt b/SnapletFork/README-finder.17.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..dc54e9d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/SnapletFork/README-finder.17.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+Snaplet finder.17 integration
+
+Base: sw33tLie/macshot v4.3.0 (5b762998a1520f90b702953c6b6460772800d6f4), GPL-3.0.
+Selected upstream changes through v4.4.0-beta.6:
+- #349 progressive sequential multi-display capture, pointer screen first; retain selected display focus.
+- 1e69fb14: opt-in selected-format clipboard representations, PNG/TIFF fallback, WebP straight alpha and size guards.
+- 47693fe3: bounded OCR attempts and fast fallback shared by consumers.
+- ad245b50: repair temporary microphone IDs and respect selected microphone in level meter.
+- b05aeac/2501b9f/38cb9d2: copy audio buffers, duration-based bounded queues and tolerate transient encoder congestion.
+
+Fork integration:
+- Preserve one NSPasteboardItem including Finder file URL plus selected format, PNG and TIFF.
+- Retain finder.15 keyboard ObjC route, focus and warmup generation safety, timeout and orphan guards.
+- Do not include withdrawn finder.16 memory/window changes or uninstalled filter optimization.
+- Single-screen full capture remains pointer-display-only; area/recording retain multi-display coverage.
+- No developer identity changes or Apple notarization; ad-hoc signing remains and macOS may require permission renewal.
+
+New-format clipboard is opt-in under Capture / Output. Image-format encoding remains dependent on OS ImageIO support, with PNG fallback if an optional encoder fails.
diff --git a/SnapletFork/RELEASE-NOTES-finder.17.txt b/SnapletFork/RELEASE-NOTES-finder.17.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..fcb41df
--- /dev/null
+++ b/SnapletFork/RELEASE-NOTES-finder.17.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+Snaplet 4.3.0-finder.17 — 上游功能与稳定性更新
+
+- 多屏顺序捕获，鼠标所在屏幕优先，抓取完成即显示；后续屏幕不抢走正在框选屏幕的键盘焦点。
+- 可选复制当前输出格式（HEIC、AVIF 等），保留 PNG/TIFF，并与 Finder 文件链接放在同一个剪贴板项目中。
+- OCR 识别超时与快速模式回退，覆盖文字识别、翻译、自动遮盖及智能标记。
+- 修复旧默认麦克风 ID 失效，音量表跟随所选设备。
+- 复制音频缓冲、按音频时长限制队列，编码器短暂堵塞时继续录制；裁剪至音频结束之后的导出可正常完成。
+- 修复 WebP 半透明边缘变暗及超大图编码保护。
+- 保留 finder.15 的 Esc/回车、预热竞态、截图超时和隐藏会话恢复修复；不包含已撤回的 finder.16 窗口优化。
+
+验证：59个移植测试用例通过；Release构建、键盘事件路由、预热竞态、隐藏会话恢复及渐进捕获源码检查通过。实际多屏与外接麦克风尚未实机验证。
+
+此版本采用临时签名；更新后 macOS 可能要求重新登记原有录屏权限。
